Learning Machines

Who are the brain police? The invention of these mothers and fathers produces a necessity to learn machines, and the software is hard approaching.

Should we license the bicycles for the mind? Moving violations of public private works works to violate the emotion that no men are equally endowed with natural creativity, when a machine can make a jazz noise here.

You are what you is, or you is what they was? Material minds train on material from trained minds, over and over without recourse in the course of human events, so we must impel no separation and learn from machines learning from us.
